    "number": 19,
    "summary": "Jehoshaphat is rebuked for helping ungodly Ahab—He helps the people return to the Lord, sets up judges, and administers justice.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And Jehoshaphat the king of Judah returned to his house in peace to Jerusalem.",
